    merge messages: up to 20 lanes; each matching scope merges at most 32 first-term words, further terms filter; past 32 words a lane is incomplete (word_cut_at names it), later lanes continue; meter ceilings remain query-wide
    scan members.byPrincipalRoom first 20 — rule decided by the prefix: no probes
      sort/group/sum/count consume this page, not the whole population
    scan messages.byRoomWords first 20 — rule uniform over the prefix: one verdict
